IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ACCTPST.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT TXN-IN ASSIGN TO TXNIN.
           SELECT ACCT-OUT ASSIGN TO ACCTOUT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD TXN-IN.
       01 TXN-IN-REC PIC X(100).
       FD ACCT-OUT.
       01 ACCT-OUT-REC PIC X(90).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY TXNREC.
       COPY ACCTREC.
       01 WS-RC PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING WS-RC.
       MAIN.
           OPEN INPUT TXN-IN OUTPUT ACCT-OUT
           PERFORM UNTIL TXN-IN-REC = HIGH-VALUES
             READ TXN-IN AT END MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO TXN-IN-REC
             NOT AT END CALL 'TXNVAL' USING TXN-IN-REC WS-RC
               IF WS-RC = 0 CALL 'FEECLAC' USING TXN-IN-REC WS-RC END-IF
             END-READ
           END-PERFORM
           CLOSE TXN-IN ACCT-OUT
           GOBACK.
